Lemma 13.2.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"717"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>738</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{end}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{end}_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1c088d04d4303598\" href=\"?note=1c088d04d4303598\" title=\"56-df-graph-unravelling\">56-df-graph-unravelling</a>；同态谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma\n(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),G,\\operatorname{end}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma\n(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),G,\\operatorname{end}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{end}_G[\\operatorname{Acc}_G]\n=\\{n\\in N_G\\mid\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{end}_G[\\operatorname{Acc}_G]\n=\\{n\\in N_G\\mid\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对原书短证明，并复核具体编码：空路径终点为根；每个合法延长路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\cdot(i)\">\\(p\\cdot(i)\\)</span> 的终点是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_G(\\operatorname{end}_G(p))_i\">\\(a_G(\\operatorname{end}_G(p))_i\\)</span>；标签按终点继承。它们分别给出根、参数和Kleene标签保持。出度也随终点保持，所以展开本身满足项图谓词。像集等式直接展开访问路径定义。</p>\n<p>不要求原图根可达，也不将该同态误报为满射；其像恰为可达节点。这里是人工核对的集合论证明，未给出证明助手证书。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"t